      "en": "He did that which was evil in the LORD’s sight. He didn’t depart all his days from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.",
      "ko": "여호와 보시기에 악을 행하여 이스라엘로 범죄케 한 느밧의 아들 여로보암의 죄에서 평생 떠나지 아니하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "bb13e4a73ae0811049422c6e171f6d8f046b4499bd7acbd14b994c72da714393",
      "translation_text_hash": "d1e397f78a10992616ded265434cb6027e5bd987a2f5329ac1666a66a7ed4f01",
