      "en": "He did that which was evil in the LORD’s sight. He didn’t depart from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.",
      "ko": "여호와 보시기에 악을 행하여 이스라엘로 범죄케 한 느밧의 아들 여로보암의 죄에서 떠나지 아니하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "177ee9636810d2c85e24b874b0db1660780fa9e79ba46ccfc2b33cf10a1b77d4",
      "translation_text_hash": "332caf9a688639ccf7e5aec89137423f7e8473c955ab2f32333f1adc37d13fa4",
